    "reviewed_exclusion": "Does not block repository readiness when the exclusion has a dated rationale, user-facing boundary, and refresh trigger.",
    "external_gate": "Blocks only the relevant external outcome; repository readiness must not claim the external action or result.",
    "human_gate": "Blocks the relevant accountable judgment or attestation and cannot be manufactured from repository evidence."
  },
